      "value": "@{6227bc1f4c691f5f50ea5902|full_name} yeah I told them it's a bad idea there in the comments but no one listened\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/vrcpickup-auto-hold-does-not-work-on-any-platform-except-for-desktop-and-vive-wa\n\nI ran into these auto hold items in one of the Spookality games, if I didn't know what was going on I would've thought my controllers were broken or something.",
